My recommendation for Nethack soundtrack has been the Dio album 
"Killing the Dragon" since it was released in 2002. Too bad Ronnie died
last month.
Just look at the track names:

Killing the Dragon 
Along Comes a Spider
Scream
Better in the Dark
Rock & Roll
Push
Guilty
Throw Away Children
Before the Fall
Cold Feet

Some have very clear connections to the game, some are less obvious..
Don't we all like killing dragons, and haven't we all seen spiders
coming? 
Scream could refer to the shrieking noise of shriekers. 
Some places are dark, even though that's not necessarily a good thing.
Rock & Roll is not so obvious as such, but when you _Push_ boulders for
example in Sokoban, you really make some rocks roll..
Guilty is the feeling you have when reading a blessed scroll of
punishment.
Cockatrice eggs are kind of children you may like throwing..
Before the Fall is the point where you get overconfident and end up
killed, then you have cold fet.

